dance Shy
// The highs push the morph; the snares bring it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and the
// middle turns it; drops in the hi-hats reverse it.
// Inspired by morph shy, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.high speed 1.6 settle 1
zoom follows music.mid_hit amount 0.5 settle 94.3
spin follows music.mid from 22.9 to 218 smooth 0.6
turn on music.mid changes by 0.5
reverse on music.high_hit drops by 0.49 on 4 off 4
